{"id":"u59","kelas":"kerja","no":12,"judul":"Masukan dan Pengembangan Karier","title":"Feedback and Career Growth","emoji":"🌱","ringkas":"Memberi dan menerima masukan, evaluasi, dan target","ready":true,"goals":["memberi **masukan positif** dan **masukan membangun** (constructive feedback) dengan sopan","menerima masukan dengan terbuka dan menanggapinya secara profesional","membahas **evaluasi kinerja** (performance review): pencapaian, kekuatan, dan area perbaikan","menetapkan **target** yang jelas dan terukur","membicarakan **pengembangan karier**: pelatihan, tanggung jawab baru, dan promosi","memakai **modal** dan **conditional** untuk saran: [[could]], [[should]], [[It would be great if ...]]"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Masukan (*feedback*) adalah cara paling cepat untuk berkembang di tempat kerja. Masukan yang baik **spesifik, jujur, dan sopan**, sedangkan cara menerimanya menunjukkan sikap profesional. Unit ini juga membahas evaluasi kinerja dan pembicaraan tentang karier."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Memberi masukan positif","table":[["Ungkapan","Contoh"],["[[You did a great job on ...]]","[[You did a great job on the presentation.]]"],["[[I really liked the way you ...]]","[[I really liked the way you handled the client.]]"],["[[Thank you for ... It made a big difference.]]","[[Thank you for staying late. It made a big difference.]]"],["[[Well done on ...]]","[[Well done on finishing the project early.]]"],["[[Keep up the good work.]]","[[Your reports are clear. Keep up the good work.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Memberi masukan membangun","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan","Contoh"],["Membuka lembut","[[Can I give you some feedback?]]","[[Can I give you some feedback on the report?]]"],["Menyebut area perbaikan","[[One thing you could improve is ...]]","[[One thing you could improve is the layout.]]"],["Saran","[[It would be even better if ...]] / [[Next time, you might want to ...]]","[[It would be even better if you added examples.]]"],["Menjelaskan alasan","[[That way, ...]] / [[This will help ...]]","[[That way, readers will understand quickly.]]"],["Menawarkan bantuan","[[I'm happy to help with that.]]","[[I'm happy to help you practise.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Pola 'sandwich'","text":"Mulai dengan **hal positif**, sampaikan **satu area perbaikan** yang spesifik, lalu tutup dengan **dukungan atau dorongan**. Contoh: [[Your slides were clear. One thing you could improve is the speaking pace. I'm sure it will get better with practice.]]"},{"t":"warn","title":"Hindari kata-kata menyerang","text":"Fokus pada **perilaku atau hasil kerja**, bukan pribadi. Katakan [[The report had several errors.]], bukan [[You are careless.]] Hindari [[always]] dan [[never]]: [[You always make mistakes.]] terdengar menuduh."},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Menerima masukan","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you for your feedback.]] / [[I appreciate you telling me.]]"],["Mengakui","[[You're right. I should have checked it again.]]"],["Klarifikasi","[[Could you give me an example?]] / [[What would you suggest I do differently?]]"],["Berkomitmen","[[I'll work on it.]] / [[I'll make sure it doesn't happen again.]]"],["Tidak setuju (sopan)","[[I see your point, but I'd like to explain my side.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"feedback","id":"masukan","ex":"Thank you for your feedback."},{"en":"constructive","id":"membangun","ex":"She gave constructive feedback."},{"en":"performance review","id":"evaluasi kinerja","ex":"My performance review is on Friday."},{"en":"strength","id":"kekuatan","ex":"Teamwork is his strength."},{"en":"weakness","id":"kelemahan","ex":"Time management is my weakness."},{"en":"area for improvement","id":"area yang perlu diperbaiki","ex":"This is an area for improvement."},{"en":"achievement","id":"pencapaian","ex":"Her biggest achievement was the new system."},{"en":"goal / target","id":"tujuan / target","ex":"We set a clear goal."},{"en":"promotion","id":"kenaikan jabatan","ex":"He got a promotion."},{"en":"raise","id":"kenaikan gaji","ex":"She asked for a raise."},{"en":"training course","id":"kursus pelatihan","ex":"I'd like to take a training course."},{"en":"skill","id":"keterampilan","ex":"Communication is a key skill."},{"en":"mentor","id":"pembimbing","ex":"My mentor helped me a lot."},{"en":"responsibility","id":"tanggung jawab","ex":"I'd like more responsibility."},{"en":"career path","id":"jalur karier","ex":"What's my career path here?"}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Evaluasi kinerja","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Membuka","[[Let's talk about how this year has gone.]]"],["Pencapaian","[[This year you've exceeded your sales target by 10%.]]"],["Kekuatan","[[Your strengths are communication and reliability.]]"],["Area perbaikan","[[An area for improvement is time management.]]"],["Target baru","[[For next year, let's aim to ...]]"],["Dukungan","[[What support do you need from me?]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Membicarakan karier","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menyatakan minat","[[I'd like to develop my skills in ...]] / [[I'm interested in taking on more responsibility.]]"],["Meminta pelatihan","[[Would it be possible to attend a training course on ...?]]"],["Menanyakan peluang","[[What opportunities are there for growth in this team?]]"],["Menyatakan target","[[In the next two years, I hope to become ...]]"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you for your support and guidance.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Memberi masukan","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Dina, can I give you some feedback on your presentation?","id":"Dina, boleh saya memberi masukan tentang presentasimu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes, please. I'd really appreciate it.","id":"Ya, silakan. Saya akan sangat menghargainya."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"You did a great job on the slides. They were clear and simple. One thing you could improve is your speaking pace. You spoke a little fast.","id":"Kamu melakukan pekerjaan hebat pada slide. Slide-nya jelas dan sederhana. Satu hal yang bisa diperbaiki adalah tempo bicaramu. Kamu berbicara agak cepat."},{"who":"Dina","en":"You're right. I was nervous. What would you suggest I do?","id":"Ibu benar. Saya gugup. Apa saran Ibu?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Try practising with a timer, and pause after each key point. I'm happy to listen to your rehearsal.","id":"Cobalah berlatih dengan pengatur waktu, dan jeda setelah tiap poin penting. Saya senang mendengarkan latihanmu."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Evaluasi kinerja","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Tom, let's talk about how this year has gone. You've exceeded your sales target by 10%.","id":"Tom, mari bicarakan bagaimana tahun ini berjalan. Kamu melampaui target penjualan sebesar 10%."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Thank you. I'm glad to hear that.","id":"Terima kasih. Saya senang mendengarnya."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Your strengths are communication and reliability. An area for improvement is report writing. For next year, let's aim to improve that.","id":"Kekuatanmu adalah komunikasi dan keandalan. Area yang perlu diperbaiki adalah penulisan laporan. Untuk tahun depan, mari kita targetkan memperbaikinya."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Would it be possible to attend a training course on business writing?","id":"Apakah mungkin mengikuti kursus penulisan bisnis?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Yes, I'll arrange that. Is there anything else you'd like to discuss, such as your career plans?","id":"Ya, saya akan mengaturnya. Adakah hal lain yang ingin dibahas, misalnya rencana kariermu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"I'd like to take on more responsibility, perhaps as a team leader in the future.","id":"Saya ingin mengambil lebih banyak tanggung jawab, mungkin sebagai ketua tim di masa depan."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Positif: [[You did a great job on ...]]; membangun: [[One thing you could improve is ...]].","Pola sandwich: **positif → perbaikan → dukungan**; fokus pada perilaku, bukan pribadi.","Menerima: [[Thank you for your feedback.]], [[I'll work on it.]]","Evaluasi: **pencapaian → kekuatan → area perbaikan → target**.","Karier: [[I'd like to develop my skills in ...]], [[Would it be possible to attend a course?]]"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["feedback","masukan"],["promotion","kenaikan jabatan"],["mentor","pembimbing"],["goal","tujuan"],["responsibility","tanggung jawab"]],"exp":"Kosakata umpan balik.","k":"0c78879a"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan fungsi dengan ungkapan:","pairs":[["memuji","You did a great job on ..."],["menyarankan","It would be even better if ..."],["berterima kasih","Thank you for your feedback."],["berkomitmen","I'll work on it."]],"exp":"Fungsi ungkapan.","k":"3c7dc62c"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian evaluasi dengan contoh:","pairs":[["achievement","You exceeded your target."],["strength","Your strength is communication."],["improvement","An area for improvement is time management."],["goal","Let's aim to finish earlier."]],"exp":"Bagian evaluasi.","k":"da050c1d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan memulai masukan adalah...","options":["Can I give you some feedback?","You must change.","Listen to me.","You are bad."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"f594fff6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana masukan positif?","options":["You did a great job on the report.","The report is bad.","You are careless.","Do it again."],"answer":0,"exp":"Positif.","k":"535f84fe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana masukan yang membangun?","options":["One thing you could improve is the layout.","Your layout is stupid.","You never do it right.","I hate it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Spesifik dan sopan.","k":"d9d2db1c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pola 'sandwich' berarti...","options":["positif, perbaikan, dukungan","kritik, kritik, kritik","pujian saja","diam saja"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sandwich.","k":"2c80b1a3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyerang pribadi (hindari)?","options":["You are always careless.","The report had errors.","Next time, check it twice.","It would be better if you checked."],"answer":0,"exp":"always careless.","k":"563ab8d3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menerima masukan yang profesional adalah...","options":["Thank you for your feedback. I'll work on it.","That's not true.","You don't understand.","Whatever."],"answer":0,"exp":"Terbuka.","k":"8eea55d9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara meminta contoh adalah...","options":["Could you give me an example?","Prove it.","Why?","Say more."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"c6689093"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara meminta pelatihan adalah...","options":["Would it be possible to attend a training course?","Give me a course.","I want training now.","Train me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"8919413b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menyatakan minat karier adalah...","options":["I'd like to take on more responsibility.","I'll leave.","I hate work.","No responsibility."],"answer":0,"exp":"Minat.","k":"4d9fa716"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat present perfect yang benar adalah...","options":["You've exceeded your target.","You has exceeded your target.","You exceeded have your target.","You are exceeded your target."],"answer":0,"exp":"have + V3.","k":"dc4c5379"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu melakukan pekerjaan hebat.","q":"You did a great ___ on the report.","answers":["job"],"hint":"pekerjaan","exp":"did a great job.","k":"d4f68268"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ada satu hal yang bisa diperbaiki.","q":"One thing you could ___ is the layout.","answers":["improve"],"hint":"memperbaiki","exp":"could improve.","k":"d49759fd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Lebih baik jika kamu menambah contoh.","q":"It would be even ___ if you added examples.","answers":["better"],"hint":"lebih baik","exp":"even better.","k":"0aab1382"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas masukanmu.","q":"Thank you for your ___.","answers":["feedback"],"hint":"masukan","exp":"feedback.","k":"dfda0004"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan mengusahakannya.","q":"I'll ___ on it.","answers":["work"],"hint":"bekerja","exp":"work on it.","k":"b83ed0d9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia mendapat kenaikan jabatan.","q":"She got a ___.","answers":["promotion"],"hint":"kenaikan jabatan","exp":"promotion.","k":"82de93f2"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Boleh saya memberi masukan kepadamu?\"","answer":"Can I give you some feedback?","exp":"give you some feedback.","k":"386c79d8"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya ingin mengembangkan keterampilan saya.\"","answer":"I would like to develop my skills.","exp":"would like to + V1.","k":"c0379f5c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"You did a great job on the presentation","options":["Kamu melakukan pekerjaan hebat pada presentasi","Presentasi itu buruk","Presentasi dibatalkan","Aku suka presentasi"],"answer":0,"exp":"great job.","k":"45750699"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"One thing you could improve is your speaking pace","options":["Satu hal yang bisa diperbaiki adalah tempo bicaramu","Kamu bicara sangat baik","Tempo bicaramu lambat sekali","Aku tidak mau bicara"],"answer":0,"exp":"pace.","k":"c12fc64c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I would like to take on more responsibility","options":["Saya ingin mengambil lebih banyak tanggung jawab","Saya tidak mau bertanggung jawab","Saya menolak tugas","Saya baru bekerja"],"answer":0,"exp":"take on.","k":"bf5fab09"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kerja bagus menyelesaikan proyek lebih awal.","q":"Well ___ on finishing the project early.","answers":["done"],"hint":"selesai","exp":"Well done.","k":"bf8d8701"},{"type":"fill","id":"Teruslah bekerja dengan baik.","q":"Keep up the good ___.","answers":["work"],"hint":"kerja","exp":"good work.","k":"48540f45"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya suka cara Anda menangani klien.","q":"I really liked the ___ you handled the client.","answers":["way"],"hint":"cara","exp":"the way.","k":"c18cdd4a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Lain kali, Anda mungkin ingin memeriksa dua kali.","q":"Next time, you might want ___ check twice.","answers":["to"],"hint":"to","exp":"might want to.","k":"712afa5d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dengan begitu, pembaca akan paham.","q":"That ___, readers will understand.","answers":["way"],"hint":"cara","exp":"That way.","k":"14aa2bdf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya senang membantu.","q":"I'm ___ to help.","answers":["happy","glad"],"hint":"senang","exp":"happy to help.","k":"cc6c1444"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu melampaui targetmu.","q":"You've ___ your target. (exceed)","answers":["exceeded"],"hint":"V3","exp":"exceeded.","k":"e36abb20"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia meminta kenaikan gaji.","q":"She asked for a ___.","answers":["raise"],"hint":"kenaikan gaji","exp":"raise.","k":"1815a220"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya ingin mengikuti kursus pelatihan.","q":"I'd like to take a training ___.","answers":["course"],"hint":"kursus","exp":"training course.","k":"78904047"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pembimbing saya sangat membantu.","q":"My ___ was very helpful.","answers":["mentor"],"hint":"pembimbing","exp":"mentor.","k":"c784543b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kelemahan saya adalah mengatur waktu.","q":"My ___ is time management.","answers":["weakness"],"hint":"kelemahan","exp":"weakness.","k":"007da44a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang masukan positif dan spesifik?","options":["I really liked the way you explained the data.","Good.","Nice.","OK."],"answer":0,"exp":"Spesifik.","k":"b59e625b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang masukan membangun dan sopan?","options":["It would be even better if you added a summary.","Your report is trash.","Redo it.","No."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"c4d38e9d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat setelah menerima kritik?","options":["Thank you. Could you give me an example?","You are wrong.","I don't care.","Stop."],"answer":0,"exp":"Terbuka.","k":"e6d64f04"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat untuk berkomitmen?","options":["I'll make sure it doesn't happen again.","It will happen again.","Maybe.","Not me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Berkomitmen.","k":"024f5f20"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat untuk menyatakan target?","options":["In the next two years, I hope to become a team leader.","I hope nothing.","Two years.","Leader."],"answer":0,"exp":"Target karier.","k":"65c79157"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang berarti 'area perbaikan'?","options":["area for improvement","area of fun","area code","area rug"],"answer":0,"exp":"area for improvement.","k":"84a2a20b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang berarti 'pencapaian'?","options":["achievement","achiever","adventure","advance"],"answer":0,"exp":"achievement.","k":"948c177d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["She has been promoted to manager.","She has promoted to manager.","She was promote to manager.","She is promoting manager."],"answer":0,"exp":"has been promoted.","k":"f114b37c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I'd like to improve my communication skills.","I'd like improve my communication skills.","I'd like to improving my skills.","I like to improves skills."],"answer":0,"exp":"would like to + V1.","k":"93defc54"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"constructive\" artinya...","options":["membangun","merusak","membosankan","membingungkan"],"answer":0,"exp":"constructive.","k":"396e1d02"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"reliable\" artinya...","options":["dapat diandalkan","lambat","marah","malas"],"answer":0,"exp":"reliable.","k":"61f25a81"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"punctual\" artinya...","options":["tepat waktu","terlambat","berisik","hemat"],"answer":0,"exp":"punctual.","k":"ac99823c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menunjukkan sikap profesional saat dikritik?","options":["Mendengarkan dan bertanya cara memperbaiki","Membantah keras","Meninggalkan ruangan","Menyalahkan orang lain"],"answer":0,"exp":"Profesional.","k":"515549fc"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kekuatan Anda adalah komunikasi dan keandalan.\"","answer":"Your strengths are communication and reliability.","exp":"Your strengths are ...","k":"76e47c20"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan lawan kata:","pairs":[["strength","weakness"],["praise","criticism"],["promotion","demotion"],["success","failure"]],"exp":"Lawan kata.","k":"1168e3db"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Can I give you some feedback","options":["Boleh saya memberi masukan kepadamu","Boleh saya meminjam pulpen","Boleh saya pulang","Boleh saya bertanya jam"],"answer":0,"exp":"feedback.","k":"9002c5e5"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I will work on it","options":["Saya akan mengusahakannya","Saya bekerja di sana","Saya tidak mau","Saya sudah selesai"],"answer":0,"exp":"work on.","k":"7a2e4341"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas masukannya.","q":"Thank you for your ___.","answers":["feedback"],"hint":"masukan","exp":"feedback.","k":"46c77454"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pekerjaan Anda sangat baik.","q":"You did a great ___.","answers":["job"],"hint":"pekerjaan","exp":"great job.","k":"9f5e1c6b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Anda bisa meningkatkan presentasi Anda.","q":"You could ___ your presentation.","answers":["improve"],"hint":"meningkatkan","exp":"improve.","k":"f99af255"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya ingin mengembangkan keterampilan saya.","q":"I want to ___ my skills.","answers":["develop"],"hint":"mengembangkan","exp":"develop.","k":"624149a4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya ingin ikut pelatihan.","q":"I would like to attend a ___ course.","answers":["training"],"hint":"pelatihan","exp":"training.","k":"869bdee9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tujuan karier saya adalah menjadi manajer.","q":"My career ___ is to become a manager.","answers":["goal"],"hint":"tujuan","exp":"goal.","k":"2a2525b0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Evaluasi kinerja dilakukan setiap tahun.","q":"A performance ___ is done every year.","answers":["review","appraisal"],"hint":"evaluasi","exp":"review.","k":"8149bd69"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya menghargai kritik yang membangun.","q":"I appreciate ___ criticism.","answers":["constructive"],"hint":"membangun","exp":"constructive.","k":"5a94cf0f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia dipromosikan bulan lalu.","q":"He was 